<p>I really like this! I thought the same as LordBlaze when I first read it, but then it said it didn't have a name&#8230; Just the right amount of creepy. Seems a little odd that the foundation would put so much trust in the entity, however, as the school has effectively been given free rein over the containment of a ton of anomalies. Could be potential for some later stories?</p>
<p>Also, quick nitpick- Glacier Peak is in the Cascade range, not the Rockies :)</p>
<p>EDIT- on a closer reread, free rein might not be the best term, as it doesn't know what is being contained within it- still, it holds the power in the situation no matter what it thinks. Also, the condition of the skip being out of the loop on the anomalous properties might change, as it is always learning&#8230; anyway. +1</p>

